  "account": "锦绣千秋录",
  "source_title": "秋天最美的十座古刹，有人猜灵隐寺，有人猜悬空寺，可榜首那座连大殿都没有，只守着一株千年银杏。\n#秋日古刹 #中国古刹 #人文古迹",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 406.535011,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "要说中国哪里的秋天，能一边看尽漫山秋色，一边把心安静下来，古刹绝对算得上一个。可您知道中国秋天最震撼心灵的古刹是哪一座吗？有人说是灵隐寺一千七百年的江南古刹，满寺桂花香。有人说是悬空寺，在悬崖上挂了一千五百年错。灵隐寺连前五都进不了悬空寺，也不是第一，真正排在榜首的那座不是皇家名寺，不在佛教名山，连像样的大殿都没有。院子里有一棵树，相传是一位皇帝亲手栽下的一千四百年了。今天，咱们就来盘点中国十大最震撼心灵的秋日古刹。话不多说，茶给您沏好了，劳烦您顺手点个小红心，咱们这就开讲。第十名寒山寺，江苏苏州枫桥边上，月落乌啼霜满天，江枫渔火对愁眠，写的就是他一千二百多年前的一个秋叶，相传落了地的书生。张继把船停在枫桥下，躺着睡不着。霜是冷的，渔火是晃的，心里是一场空。就在这会儿，半夜里一记钟声从寺里荡出来，穿过双气落到他的船头。这座寺始建于南朝梁代一千五百多年了，可真正让他传遍天下的就是那二十八个字，一个失一人一计，终生满心的委屈就被敲散了。您说这穿越千年的夜半钟声算不算世间最好的定心丸？第九名，红螺寺，北京怀柔红螺山南路老北京人都念叨一句老话，男败雍和，女败红罗。这座寺始建于东晋，一千六百多年了，是北方历史最悠久的佛教名刹之一。一进山门，您会先被满山的红叶晃了眼，层层叠叠，铺到山顶，像一块摊开的锦缎，寺里还有一对上千年的古银杏。一雌一雄分立在殿前两侧，深秋一到，满树金黄树下，全是母亲在为儿女磕头祈福。母亲们不求自己大富大贵。只盼孩子一生平安顺遂，漫山红叶是秋色。这满殿母爱才是红螺寺最动人的慈悲。您说这天底下的母爱是不是比满山彩叶还要厚厚住？第八名灵隐寺，浙江杭州。他坐落在飞来峰下，一千六百多载，光阴深秋时节，满似金桂飘香洪峰，斜掩着斑驳黄墙冷泉，溪水在脚边潺潺流过清冽，空气里全是一股子沁人心脾的甜香。您走在石阶上，看着济公殿前那尊笑眯眯的佛像，大度能容天下事，心里那些纠结，瞬间就释怀了。人生过半，争了一辈子，操劳了一辈子，到头来随遇而安才是真。这满四金桂配一系平常心，您说这算不算最通透的智慧？第七名苏州西园寺门外，就在留园隔壁。这座寺始建元代，后来一户官宦人家舍园为斯，所以他不像别的明察那样森严，倒像一座大园子。深秋的放生池，水清见底，金黄的银杏落满庭院，几十只四猫，趴在落叶堆里晒太阳，谁走过都懒得睁眼。连廊底下，您捧一碗热气腾腾的素面，一口汤下去，从嗓子暖到胃里。这儿没有惊天动地的传说，也没有悬崖绝壁，可人到了一定岁数才懂折腾了大半辈子。最想要的不过是有太阳晒有猫胚，有一碗热汤。您说这算不算最朴素的慈悲？第六名，山西大同悬空寺、浑源县金龙峡。讲到这儿，分量可就彻底沉下来了。他凌空挂在百米垂直绝壁上，一千五百年深秋，峡谷里秋风呼啸，两岸黄叶翻飞，整座古寺紧靠几根飞梁暗插在悬崖里凌空傲立。您扶着木兰往下瞅一眼，脚底下是万丈深渊，冷风直往领口里钻。可这木楼历经风雨，连雷击愣是一寸都没挪动过。修他的人早已化作尘土，他却在绝壁上站成了铁骨头。您说，这份千百年屹立不倒的气魄，怎能不让人肃然起敬？从第十到第六名，寒山寺的一骑钟声敲散了，落地书生的愁红罗寺的满山红叶里，全是母亲的牵挂。灵隐寺一缕桂香化开，半生执念，西园寺的一碗素面，暖了人间的冷悬空寺，在悬崖绝壁上硬撑了一千五百年，可他们还不是最震撼心灵的。接下来第五道第一名更动人，有一座古刹，满山红枫如火，千年石窟在烈火般的秋色里静坐。有一座寺门前，就是大海潮生，日夜不停的往人心里涌，可排在榜首的那座深秋，山风一吹，便能下一场天地间最壮阔的万叶金雨。他是哪座？他凭什么排在灵隐寺和悬空寺前面，下一集已经同步更新，点开我的头像，进入主页，就能看到点个关注，咱们下集接着聊。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00001",
      "start_ms": 310,
      "end_ms": 2130,
      "text": "要说中国哪里的秋天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2410,
      "end_ms": 4770,
      "text": "能一边看尽漫山秋色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5350,
      "end_ms": 7350,
      "text": "一边把心安静下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00004",
      "start_ms": 7910,
      "end_ms": 9730,
      "text": "古刹绝对算得上一个。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00005",
      "start_ms": 10410,
      "end_ms": 14870,
      "text": "可您知道中国秋天最震撼心灵的古刹是哪一座吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00006",
      "start_ms": 15230,
      "end_ms": 19310,
      "text": "有人说是灵隐寺一千七百年的江南古刹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00007",
      "start_ms": 19710,
      "end_ms": 20870,
      "text": "满寺桂花香。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00008",
      "start_ms": 21650,
      "end_ms": 23250,
      "text": "有人说是悬空寺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00009",
      "start_ms": 23790,
      "end_ms": 26730,
      "text": "在悬崖上挂了一千五百年错。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00010",
      "start_ms": 27370,
      "end_ms": 31020,
      "text": "灵隐寺连前五都进不了悬空寺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00011",
      "start_ms": 31080,
      "end_ms": 32020,
      "text": "也不是第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00012",
      "start_ms": 32440,
      "end_ms": 36760,
      "text": "真正排在榜首的那座不是皇家名寺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00013",
      "start_ms": 37040,
      "end_ms": 38440,
      "text": "不在佛教名山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00014",
      "start_ms": 39040,
      "end_ms": 41300,
      "text": "连像样的大殿都没有。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00015",
      "start_ms": 41640,
      "end_ms": 42980,
      "text": "院子里有一棵树，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00016",
      "start_ms": 43520,
      "end_ms": 48480,
      "text": "相传是一位皇帝亲手栽下的一千四百年了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00017",
      "start_ms": 49080,
      "end_ms": 49560,
      "text": "今天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00018",
      "start_ms": 49580,
      "end_ms": 54520,
      "text": "咱们就来盘点中国十大最震撼心灵的秋日古刹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00019",
      "start_ms": 54920,
      "end_ms": 55720,
      "text": "话不多说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00020",
      "start_ms": 55960,
      "end_ms": 57220,
      "text": "茶给您沏好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00021",
      "start_ms": 57440,
      "end_ms": 59260,
      "text": "劳烦您顺手点个小红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00022",
      "start_ms": 59480,
      "end_ms": 60555,
      "text": "咱们这就开讲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00023",
      "start_ms": 60870,
      "end_ms": 63125,
      "text": "第十名寒山寺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00024",
      "start_ms": 63550,
      "end_ms": 66125,
      "text": "江苏苏州枫桥边上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00025",
      "start_ms": 66710,
      "end_ms": 68695,
      "text": "月落乌啼霜满天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00026",
      "start_ms": 69100,
      "end_ms": 71095,
      "text": "江枫渔火对愁眠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00027",
      "start_ms": 71480,
      "end_ms": 75145,
      "text": "写的就是他一千二百多年前的一个秋叶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00028",
      "start_ms": 75830,
      "end_ms": 77490,
      "text": "相传落了地的书生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00029",
      "start_ms": 77490,
      "end_ms": 80245,
      "text": "张继把船停在枫桥下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00030",
      "start_ms": 80710,
      "end_ms": 81725,
      "text": "躺着睡不着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00031",
      "start_ms": 82640,
      "end_ms": 83625,
      "text": "霜是冷的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00032",
      "start_ms": 84080,
      "end_ms": 85145,
      "text": "渔火是晃的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00033",
      "start_ms": 85730,
      "end_ms": 87075,
      "text": "心里是一场空。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00034",
      "start_ms": 87540,
      "end_ms": 88395,
      "text": "就在这会儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00035",
      "start_ms": 88890,
      "end_ms": 92155,
      "text": "半夜里一记钟声从寺里荡出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00036",
      "start_ms": 92660,
      "end_ms": 95675,
      "text": "穿过双气落到他的船头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00037",
      "start_ms": 96460,
      "end_ms": 100615,
      "text": "这座寺始建于南朝梁代一千五百多年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00038",
      "start_ms": 101030,
      "end_ms": 105345,
      "text": "可真正让他传遍天下的就是那二十八个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00039",
      "start_ms": 106050,
      "end_ms": 108070,
      "text": "一个失一人一计，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00040",
      "start_ms": 108070,
      "end_ms": 112215,
      "text": "终生满心的委屈就被敲散了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00041",
      "start_ms": 112970,
      "end_ms": 119715,
      "text": "您说这穿越千年的夜半钟声算不算世间最好的定心丸？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00042",
      "start_ms": 120110,
      "end_ms": 120935,
      "text": "第九名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00043",
      "start_ms": 121380,
      "end_ms": 122165,
      "text": "红螺寺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00044",
      "start_ms": 122560,
      "end_ms": 128025,
      "text": "北京怀柔红螺山南路老北京人都念叨一句老话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00045",
      "start_ms": 128520,
      "end_ms": 129600,
      "text": "男败雍和，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00046",
      "start_ms": 130000,
      "end_ms": 131175,
      "text": "女败红罗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00047",
      "start_ms": 131640,
      "end_ms": 133295,
      "text": "这座寺始建于东晋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00048",
      "start_ms": 133790,
      "end_ms": 135125,
      "text": "一千六百多年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00049",
      "start_ms": 135570,
      "end_ms": 139205,
      "text": "是北方历史最悠久的佛教名刹之一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00050",
      "start_ms": 139950,
      "end_ms": 140850,
      "text": "一进山门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00051",
      "start_ms": 141170,
      "end_ms": 143785,
      "text": "您会先被满山的红叶晃了眼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00052",
      "start_ms": 144430,
      "end_ms": 145410,
      "text": "层层叠叠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00053",
      "start_ms": 145410,
      "end_ms": 146235,
      "text": "铺到山顶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00054",
      "start_ms": 146810,
      "end_ms": 148715,
      "text": "像一块摊开的锦缎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00055",
      "start_ms": 149130,
      "end_ms": 151765,
      "text": "寺里还有一对上千年的古银杏。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00056",
      "start_ms": 152290,
      "end_ms": 155785,
      "text": "一雌一雄分立在殿前两侧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00057",
      "start_ms": 156330,
      "end_ms": 157310,
      "text": "深秋一到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00058",
      "start_ms": 157530,
      "end_ms": 160210,
      "text": "满树金黄树下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00059",
      "start_ms": 160310,
      "end_ms": 163355,
      "text": "全是母亲在为儿女磕头祈福。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00060",
      "start_ms": 163770,
      "end_ms": 166125,
      "text": "母亲们不求自己大富大贵。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00061",
      "start_ms": 166720,
      "end_ms": 168995,
      "text": "只盼孩子一生平安顺遂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00062",
      "start_ms": 169740,
      "end_ms": 171855,
      "text": "漫山红叶是秋色。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00063",
      "start_ms": 172380,
      "end_ms": 176144,
      "text": "这满殿母爱才是红螺寺最动人的慈悲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00064",
      "start_ms": 176630,
      "end_ms": 181475,
      "text": "您说这天底下的母爱是不是比满山彩叶还要厚厚住？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00065",
      "start_ms": 181780,
      "end_ms": 183725,
      "text": "第八名灵隐寺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00066",
      "start_ms": 184250,
      "end_ms": 185415,
      "text": "浙江杭州。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00067",
      "start_ms": 186140,
      "end_ms": 187905,
      "text": "他坐落在飞来峰下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00068",
      "start_ms": 188400,
      "end_ms": 189720,
      "text": "一千六百多载，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00069",
      "start_ms": 189720,
      "end_ms": 191950,
      "text": "光阴深秋时节，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00070",
      "start_ms": 192050,
      "end_ms": 194650,
      "text": "满似金桂飘香洪峰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00071",
      "start_ms": 194790,
      "end_ms": 197660,
      "text": "斜掩着斑驳黄墙冷泉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00072",
      "start_ms": 197780,
      "end_ms": 201360,
      "text": "溪水在脚边潺潺流过清冽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00073",
      "start_ms": 201380,
      "end_ms": 204835,
      "text": "空气里全是一股子沁人心脾的甜香。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00074",
      "start_ms": 205660,
      "end_ms": 207095,
      "text": "您走在石阶上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00075",
      "start_ms": 207450,
      "end_ms": 210245,
      "text": "看着济公殿前那尊笑眯眯的佛像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00076",
      "start_ms": 210760,
      "end_ms": 212395,
      "text": "大度能容天下事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00077",
      "start_ms": 212820,
      "end_ms": 213900,
      "text": "心里那些纠结，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00078",
      "start_ms": 214120,
      "end_ms": 215565,
      "text": "瞬间就释怀了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00079",
      "start_ms": 216000,
      "end_ms": 217055,
      "text": "人生过半，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00080",
      "start_ms": 217640,
      "end_ms": 218735,
      "text": "争了一辈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00081",
      "start_ms": 219170,
      "end_ms": 220285,
      "text": "操劳了一辈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00082",
      "start_ms": 220680,
      "end_ms": 223275,
      "text": "到头来随遇而安才是真。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00083",
      "start_ms": 223950,
      "end_ms": 226485,
      "text": "这满四金桂配一系平常心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00084",
      "start_ms": 226930,
      "end_ms": 229165,
      "text": "您说这算不算最通透的智慧？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00085",
      "start_ms": 229570,
      "end_ms": 233005,
      "text": "第七名苏州西园寺门外，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00086",
      "start_ms": 233310,
      "end_ms": 234385,
      "text": "就在留园隔壁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00087",
      "start_ms": 235190,
      "end_ms": 237135,
      "text": "这座寺始建元代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00088",
      "start_ms": 237580,
      "end_ms": 240395,
      "text": "后来一户官宦人家舍园为斯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00089",
      "start_ms": 241100,
      "end_ms": 243575,
      "text": "所以他不像别的明察那样森严，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00090",
      "start_ms": 243890,
      "end_ms": 245425,
      "text": "倒像一座大园子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00091",
      "start_ms": 245860,
      "end_ms": 247280,
      "text": "深秋的放生池，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00092",
      "start_ms": 247300,
      "end_ms": 248325,
      "text": "水清见底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00093",
      "start_ms": 248970,
      "end_ms": 251205,
      "text": "金黄的银杏落满庭院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00094",
      "start_ms": 251710,
      "end_ms": 252890,
      "text": "几十只四猫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00095",
      "start_ms": 252950,
      "end_ms": 254645,
      "text": "趴在落叶堆里晒太阳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00096",
      "start_ms": 255130,
      "end_ms": 256825,
      "text": "谁走过都懒得睁眼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00097",
      "start_ms": 257230,
      "end_ms": 258245,
      "text": "连廊底下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00098",
      "start_ms": 258660,
      "end_ms": 261495,
      "text": "您捧一碗热气腾腾的素面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00099",
      "start_ms": 261850,
      "end_ms": 263105,
      "text": "一口汤下去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00100",
      "start_ms": 263530,
      "end_ms": 265525,
      "text": "从嗓子暖到胃里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00101",
      "start_ms": 265890,
      "end_ms": 268310,
      "text": "这儿没有惊天动地的传说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00102",
      "start_ms": 268770,
      "end_ms": 270535,
      "text": "也没有悬崖绝壁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00103",
      "start_ms": 271050,
      "end_ms": 275665,
      "text": "可人到了一定岁数才懂折腾了大半辈子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00104",
      "start_ms": 276050,
      "end_ms": 280190,
      "text": "最想要的不过是有太阳晒有猫胚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00105",
      "start_ms": 280610,
      "end_ms": 281945,
      "text": "有一碗热汤。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00106",
      "start_ms": 282500,
      "end_ms": 285775,
      "text": "您说这算不算最朴素的慈悲？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00107",
      "start_ms": 286170,
      "end_ms": 286830,
      "text": "第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00108",
      "start_ms": 287230,
      "end_ms": 291535,
      "text": "山西大同悬空寺、浑源县金龙峡。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00109",
      "start_ms": 292230,
      "end_ms": 293150,
      "text": "讲到这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00110",
      "start_ms": 293470,
      "end_ms": 295370,
      "text": "分量可就彻底沉下来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00111",
      "start_ms": 295670,
      "end_ms": 298650,
      "text": "他凌空挂在百米垂直绝壁上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00112",
      "start_ms": 298690,
      "end_ms": 300930,
      "text": "一千五百年深秋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00113",
      "start_ms": 300990,
      "end_ms": 302790,
      "text": "峡谷里秋风呼啸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00114",
      "start_ms": 303170,
      "end_ms": 304690,
      "text": "两岸黄叶翻飞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00115",
      "start_ms": 305250,
      "end_ms": 310670,
      "text": "整座古寺紧靠几根飞梁暗插在悬崖里凌空傲立。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00116",
      "start_ms": 311150,
      "end_ms": 313370,
      "text": "您扶着木兰往下瞅一眼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00117",
      "start_ms": 314030,
      "end_ms": 316130,
      "text": "脚底下是万丈深渊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00118",
      "start_ms": 316130,
      "end_ms": 318950,
      "text": "冷风直往领口里钻。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00119",
      "start_ms": 318950,
      "end_ms": 321650,
      "text": "可这木楼历经风雨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00120",
      "start_ms": 321650,
      "end_ms": 325080,
      "text": "连雷击愣是一寸都没挪动过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00121",
      "start_ms": 325500,
      "end_ms": 327900,
      "text": "修他的人早已化作尘土，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00122",
      "start_ms": 328400,
      "end_ms": 331300,
      "text": "他却在绝壁上站成了铁骨头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00123",
      "start_ms": 331660,
      "end_ms": 332040,
      "text": "您说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00124",
      "start_ms": 332040,
      "end_ms": 334480,
      "text": "这份千百年屹立不倒的气魄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00125",
      "start_ms": 334840,
      "end_ms": 336800,
      "text": "怎能不让人肃然起敬？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00126",
      "start_ms": 337100,
      "end_ms": 338900,
      "text": "从第十到第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00127",
      "start_ms": 339380,
      "end_ms": 342140,
      "text": "寒山寺的一骑钟声敲散了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00128",
      "start_ms": 342300,
      "end_ms": 346380,
      "text": "落地书生的愁红罗寺的满山红叶里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00129",
      "start_ms": 346440,
      "end_ms": 348120,
      "text": "全是母亲的牵挂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00130",
      "start_ms": 348640,
      "end_ms": 351000,
      "text": "灵隐寺一缕桂香化开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00131",
      "start_ms": 351240,
      "end_ms": 352445,
      "text": "半生执念，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00132",
      "start_ms": 352980,
      "end_ms": 354720,
      "text": "西园寺的一碗素面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00133",
      "start_ms": 354920,
      "end_ms": 357560,
      "text": "暖了人间的冷悬空寺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00134",
      "start_ms": 357560,
      "end_ms": 360705,
      "text": "在悬崖绝壁上硬撑了一千五百年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00135",
      "start_ms": 361450,
      "end_ms": 364105,
      "text": "可他们还不是最震撼心灵的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00136",
      "start_ms": 364600,
      "end_ms": 366565,
      "text": "接下来第五道第一名更动人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00137",
      "start_ms": 367040,
      "end_ms": 368335,
      "text": "有一座古刹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00138",
      "start_ms": 368790,
      "end_ms": 370375,
      "text": "满山红枫如火，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00139",
      "start_ms": 370920,
      "end_ms": 374745,
      "text": "千年石窟在烈火般的秋色里静坐。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00140",
      "start_ms": 375270,
      "end_ms": 377150,
      "text": "有一座寺门前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00141",
      "start_ms": 377230,
      "end_ms": 379080,
      "text": "就是大海潮生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00142",
      "start_ms": 379320,
      "end_ms": 381925,
      "text": "日夜不停的往人心里涌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00143",
      "start_ms": 382300,
      "end_ms": 385470,
      "text": "可排在榜首的那座深秋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00144",
      "start_ms": 385630,
      "end_ms": 386625,
      "text": "山风一吹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00145",
      "start_ms": 387180,
      "end_ms": 391315,
      "text": "便能下一场天地间最壮阔的万叶金雨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00146",
      "start_ms": 391880,
      "end_ms": 392675,
      "text": "他是哪座？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00147",
      "start_ms": 393110,
      "end_ms": 397315,
      "text": "他凭什么排在灵隐寺和悬空寺前面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00148",
      "start_ms": 397730,
      "end_ms": 399465,
      "text": "下一集已经同步更新，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00149",
      "start_ms": 400320,
      "end_ms": 401400,
      "text": "点开我的头像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00150",
      "start_ms": 401420,
      "end_ms": 402160,
      "text": "进入主页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00151",
      "start_ms": 402300,
      "end_ms": 404275,
      "text": "就能看到点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd4c5a445ff91a4d_s00152",
      "start_ms": 404770,
      "end_ms": 406155,
      "text": "咱们下集接着聊。"
    }
  ],
